# Paper-aligned admission and in-engine load shaping. Ready turns remain in
# vLLM's waiting queue; Joint-v2 jointly implements the abstract gain/pressure
# priority, and forecast-aware physical-KV admission implements the upper
# pressure boundary. The rejected external Python admission gate is not part
# of FULL. run_trace_all_visit_coscheduling_matrix.py records the exact mapping
# from each paper-level sensitivity variable to these implementation knobs.
